{"version":1,"content":"<p>任天堂已經確認，《塞爾達：時之笛 重製版》由旗下EPD第三製作組負責開發。該團隊此前曾參與製作《塞爾達傳説：曠野之息》和《塞爾達傳説：王國之淚》。這一消息來自任天堂於11月2日發佈的《開發者訪談》第24期前兩章，距離遊戲正式發售僅剩三天。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/game/1584912.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T18:21:16.174167+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":124,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T18:00:05+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T18:18:16.948439+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T18:18:16.948439+00:00","content_hash":"cfe7216b3bdf2f2c40a417e513a946a2a8df738e2e0b3906d30bda3368a97508","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}